ulation of this application does not guarantee the design, size, range of motion, etc. of the actual robot.\nWhen actually installing a robot, please check the specifications on the product page.\n- Please be careful of your surroundings when using this app.", "short_description": "You can place OVR series virtual robots in real space and simulate operation.\nThe OVR series is a robot sold by Oriental Motor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1594860848028062", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210390_1594860854694728_1273340538204967659_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pHAhdXUfSncQ7kNvwH2OxwN&_nc_oc=Adober0-0k4Zk0yi3G1anqMfU_rwKaTSyIVkkH7YWGUgT8cflLLGgQAeKuUouSSuCV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ9TGG7lHA5RsCSznUeQ57vYWAxlTJ1nlF5fo2J1wE39A&oe=6AFDB8D6"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscapeMini.png", "id": "858590429630683", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_858590432964016_3799015126354441121_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xBIXi0zSrKcQ7kNvwHIWa_I&_nc_oc=AdrvG9taeXLHH6GmJN1oDDdt6OTni00tkgs_SIYIyS6XWxjjG9eOeOAkgL3G1CT_Riw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSYQQpXQbymNcnEGmLcbNM6edVF-RWs-GxYEQXLpKB9Ww&oe=6AFDBC5C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "495376463065176", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974810_495376466398509_7417159219708782199_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9CAEoUHgHd8Q7kNvwFGqNLT&_nc_oc=Adpns62uE_DIyhlftC535QbDLy-anRewdyC8pQUvhruXYb8amNi0n2tgSGCVWbxddkI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQRbgxhrUG0aeIDGkuE-LTV3XJVbQjpZIrhH7aQUGu-cA&oe=6AFDD5DB"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "486